	(text "MONOLITH DEV BOARD - SHEET INDEX\n2.  Cells and Gauge:  4S holders / pack input, BQ40Z50-R2 gauge, protection FETs, BQ294700 + F102 second-level protection, SMBus\n3.  Sleep Current and 3V3:  R_MEAS + 2x INA190 to test loops, HT7550-1 amp supply, TPS62177 3V3 rail\n4.  MCU and Sensors:  CC2340R5MODA, debug headers, TMP1075 board temperature sensors, status LED\n5.  USB Port 1  /  6.  USB Port 2  (one sheet file):  TPS25751D + TPD4S201 + BQ25756 + TPS62933 per port\nRails (power symbols): PACK_P, 3V3, GND, CELL_N (gauge VSS only)\nSpec: docs/devboard/circuit-description.md.  Changes and open items: DevBoard/README.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "17ac7dae-221c-4f1f-bf54-587de0440efb")
	)
	(text "REVISION LOG\nA0  2026-10-11  First draft from circuit description draft 5.  Author: Claude Code.  Reviewer: none yet.\nA1  2026-10-11  Layout cleanup: blocks, power symbols, notes, title blocks.  Author: Claude Code.  Reviewer: none yet.\nA2  2026-10-11  Readability pass: no overlapping text, sheet-pin names inside boxes.  Author: Claude Code.  Reviewer: none yet.\nA3  2026-10-11  Wiring pass: wires instead of labels inside each block.  Author: Claude Code.  Reviewer: none yet.\nA4  2026-10-12  Polymer bulk caps, PWR_FLAGs at rail sources, design-review fixes\n                (docs/devboard/schematic-review-2026-10-12.md).  Author: Claude Code.  Reviewer: 3-agent review.\nA5  2026-10-13  Review 2 decisions: CHG_INH fails safe (R417/R517 47k pull-up to 3V3, MCU drives low to charge),\n                MCU IWDG in hardware mode; BAT fed before F101 (TI fig. 9-12); C421/C521 100 uF; LRB520S, BSS138,\n                C109 4.7n, PPHV/VBUS caps, GND/probe test points, JLC numbers on all R/C (review 2);\n                J201/J202 SMAs replaced by OUT_LO/OUT_HI loops TP201/TP202 + GND loops TP208/TP209.  Author: Claude Code.\nA6  2026-10-14  Branch hand-review: second-level protection U102 BQ294700 + F102 WSFB1514 (TI fig. 9-11), F101 deleted;\n                D103 fitted; U202 INA190A1 JLC-placed; R405-R408 removed; USB-C liquid detection (U405/U505 TPD2S300,\n                Q403-Q406, R440/R540 DCP short, D403/D503 removed). Review 3: TPD2S300 FLT -> GPIO3 (R441), liquid-detect\n                gate pulls R442/R443, BQ25756 gate/BTST 0R R444-R449 + DNP snubbers, U401 symbol GPIO11 bidirectional.\n                Cost-down (docs/devboard/cost-down-2026-10-14.md): L401/L501 SMMS1040, L402/L502 APS0530, L201 FNR4030S,\n                U203 HT7550-1, 22u 1206 battery bank, basic/preferred passives, Q103 AO3400A, D301 red, R431 solder\n                jumper, 34 test loops -> pads, headers hand-soldered, U301 consigned.\n                Charger half-bridges IAUC45N04 -> 4 discrete PGQ04N070 per port (Q401/Q402 + new Q407/Q408).\n                6-layer 1.6 mm board (0.3 mm vias): U405/U505 TPD2S300 -> TPD4S201 (CC + SBU), D402/D502 removed,\n                J401/J501 -> TYPE-C 16PCB1.6 IP68.\n                Board: block placement (tools/place_blocks.py). Schematic tidy: title blocks, headings, MCU notes and test points.\n                Author: Logan (hand review) + Claude Code.\nA7  2026-10-14  U301 STM32WB1MMC -> CC2340R5MODA with RF match C313-C315/R321; TMP1075 U302-U306 (U305/U306 DNP)\n                replace TH301-TH305, NTC_EN and their dividers; IRQ1/IRQ2/GAUGE_BTP -> one open-drain IRQ_N\n                (R314 pull-up, R315/R114 DNP); R313 fitted; TMP1075 footprint with 0.3 mm vias.  Author: Claude Code.\nA8  2026-10-14  Review 4 (docs/devboard/schematic-review-4-2026-10-14.md): R313 220k, R314 47k, R304/R305 3.3k,\n                R322-R324 series resistors at J302/J303, C401/C402 220p, D401/D501 TVS2200, snubber R 1206,\n                TP415-TP421 probe pads, D105 J104 clamp; Notes, sheet text and MPNs updated; sheet 4 renamed\n                MCU and Sensors.  Author: Claude Code.  Reviewer: 4-agent review + Logan."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 265.43 0)
